// Payloads the packer embeds into its own executable as RCDATA resources.
//
// The file is generated by CMake at configure time from this template (see the
// `Payloads embedded as Windows resources` section of the top level
// CMakeLists.txt): the payloads are build products of this build tree, so their
// paths cannot be spelled out in a checked in resource script. Every
// placeholder is replaced by the absolute path of one payload, with every
// separator doubled, because the resource compiler reads the backslash of a
// Windows path as an escape character inside a string literal.
//
// The identifiers come from src/core/EmbeddedResourceIds.h, which the resource
// script which includes this file and the code which reads the payloads back
// share.

IDR_APPBOX_LOADER RCDATA "@APPBOX_RESOURCE_LOADER_RC@"
IDR_APPBOX_SANDBOX32 RCDATA "@APPBOX_RESOURCE_SANDBOX32_RC@"
IDR_APPBOX_SANDBOX64 RCDATA "@APPBOX_RESOURCE_SANDBOX64_RC@"
